## Get All Alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts
###
## Only CRITICAL alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts?severity=CRITICAL

###
## Only WARNING alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts?severity=WARNING

###
## Alerts for a specific metric
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts?metricName=cpu_usage_percent

###
## Combine filters
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts?severity=CRITICAL&metricName=api_response_time_ms

###
## Pagination — page 2, 10 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/alerts?page=1&size=10